{"id":"c8ba6230066eaf8b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-handle.md","title":"Handle","display":"df-handle — Handle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-handle","aliases":["58-df-handle","Handle"],"display":"df-handle — Handle","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-handle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-handle</span><span>Handle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-handle — Handle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"890a8458fc69d8c7\" href=\"?note=890a8458fc69d8c7\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,h,\\phi\\in V\">\\(M,N,h,\\phi\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\omega\">\\(k,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothHandleAttachment}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothHandleAttachment}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\\)</span> means that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold with boundary, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=D^k\\times D^{n-k}\">\\(h=D^k\\times D^{n-k}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi:S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k}\\hookrightarrow\\partial M\">\\(\\phi:S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k}\\hookrightarrow\\partial M\\)</span> is a smooth embedding with the usual collar data, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is diffeomorphic to the smoothed quotient of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\sqcup h\">\\(M\\sqcup h\\)</span> identifying each attaching-boundary point with its image under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Handle}_S,\\mathrm{Attach}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Handle}_S,\\mathrm{Attach}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Handle}_S(h,k,n)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land n\\in\\omega\\land k\\leq n\\land h=D^k\\times D^{n-k}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Handle}_S(h,k,n)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land n\\in\\omega\\land k\\leq n\\land h=D^k\\times D^{n-k}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}attachment} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S(N,M,h,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in n+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Handle}_S(h,k,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothHandleAttachment}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}attachment} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S(N,M,h,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in n+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Handle}_S(h,k,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothHandleAttachment}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}attach} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Attach}_S(M,h,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S(N,M,h,\\phi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}attach} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Attach}_S(M,h,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S(N,M,h,\\phi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Handle: product of disks; basic building block of smooth manifolds</li>\n<li>The quotient, boundary, collar and smoothing data are carried by an explicit metatheoretic attachment relation. The former equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=M\\cup_\\phi h\">\\(N=M\\cup_\\phi h\\)</span> and existentially chosen unrelated topologies did not define a set-coded manifold.</li>\n<li>Index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>: dimension of &quot;core disk&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^k\">\\(D^k\\)</span>; ranges <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0 \\leq k \\leq n\">\\(0 \\leq k \\leq n\\)</span></li>\n<li>0-handle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span>; increases components; starting building block</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-handle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^0 \\times D^n = D^n\">\\(D^0 \\times D^n = D^n\\)</span>; dual to 0-handle; fills boundary</li>\n<li>Handle decomposition: any smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold has handle decomposition; unique up to handle trades</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Milnor, Morse Theory</li>\n<li>Gompf and Stipsicz, 4-Manifolds and Kirby Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"890a8458fc69d8c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top2-topological-embedding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,h,\\phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"k,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothHandleAttachment}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"h=D^k\\times D^{n-k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi:S^{k-1}\\times D^{n-k}\\hookrightarrow\\partial M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"M\\sqcup h","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Handle}_S,\\mathrm{Attach}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Handle}_S(h,k,n)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land n\\in\\omega\\land k\\leq n\\land h=D^k\\times D^{n-k}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}attachment} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S(N,M,h,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in n+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Handle}_S(h,k,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothHandleAttachment}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N,M,h,\\phi,k,n)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handle\\text{-}attach} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Attach}_S(M,h,\\phi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists N\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AttachedManifold}_S(N,M,h,\\phi)","display":true},{"tex":"N=M\\cup_\\phi h","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"D^k","display":false},{"tex":"0 \\leq k \\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"D^0 \\times D^n = D^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2112,"backlinks":[{"id":"de427c699d9a6061","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"The handle predicate and attachment construction remain in [[../batch14/58-df-handle.md]]; framing is additional structure and is not silently built into this definition."},{"id":"e118f18d4da6f655","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Handle}_S$ (handle predicate, see [[58-df-handle]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-604","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-handle.md|58-df-handle]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["0e800aa519680c23","890a8458fc69d8c7"]}